Directory "no-such-dir" does not exist.

Usage:
    find-gaps [options] <inputDir>
Options:
    -h, --help      Print this help page.
    -v, --verbose   Also say why each item was handled the way it was, and on a
                    failure print the tool's whole output rather than its last
                    lines.
    -q, --quiet     Print errors only - no progress and no warnings.
    -x, --set <name=value>
                    Override a setting for this run: name=value, repeatable. The
                    value is held where the environment holds it, so it wins
                    over the settings file; a secret is refused - the settings
                    file is where it goes. The settings page lists the names.
